  {
    "id": "anno-maizuru_lower_p211_right-02",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "兵隊掛　百五十人　銃兵一大隊ヘ五十人宛分附"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "へいたいがかり ひゃくごじゅうにん　じゅうへいいちだいたいへ ごじゅうにんあて ぶんぷ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troop-attached staff: 150 men, allotted fifty to each rifle battalion. Since Marugame fields three rifle battalions (MASTER: 銃兵三大隊), 3 x 50 = 150 checks out. Marugame's military, overflowing to the right of the Maizuru marker."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "丸龜藩兵隊掛（銃兵附）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p211_right.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2016,1004,92,1557"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-maizuru_lower_p211_right-03",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "留守隊一大隊　六小隊ヲ以一大隊トス　一小隊五十二人　役司十二人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "るすたい いちだいたい　ろくしょうたいをもって いちだいたいとす　いちしょうたい ごじゅうににん　やくし じゅうににん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Garrison force: one battalion. Note (set as a two-column warichu, right sub-column then left): six platoons make one battalion; each platoon numbers 52 men; unit officers, 12. Six platoons of 52 gives 312 rank and file. Marugame's military, overflowing right of the Maizuru marker."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "丸龜藩留守隊"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p211_right.jpg",
