  {
    "id": "anno-maizuru_lower_p211_right-09",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "少參事　七人（六人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "しょうさんじ しちにん（ろくにん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Junior councillor (shosanji). The column prints 七人 (7 persons) in full-size type, centred on the office column, and a smaller 六人 (6 persons) is set immediately to its right in the inter-column gutter and slightly higher; the parentheses here are editorial, added so the two figures can be told apart in a flat string, since none are printed on the page. The same construction appears at Yajima (少參事 一人（五人）) and Fukui (大參事 三人（四人）). The name count settles which figure is operative: six names follow - Noda Shin, Mizutani Kansui, Makino Hyozo, Takeuchi Hyoemon, Terada Tsuka and Morimoto Jugo - so 六人 is the corrected figure and 七人 the error it corrects."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "少參事"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p211_right.jpg",
