      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "兵隊　藩兵三百二十人　士分二百三人　卒百拾七人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "へいたい　はんぺい さんびゃくにじゅうにん　しぶん にひゃくさんにん　そつ ひゃくじゅうしちにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: domain force of 320 men, of whom 203 hold samurai status (shibun) and 117 are foot-rank soldiers (sotsu). The heading 兵隊 stands in its own short column with the figures in the column to its left, the two sub-counts set as a warichu (士分 in the right sub-column, 卒 in the left). Arithmetic checks: 203 + 117 = 320, and the total agrees with MASTER's two rows for this page."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "兵隊"
      }
